          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "line1": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-3vw\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255,181,0);\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-3-5-vw\"><span class=\"fontsize-4vw\">Cranial Guidance Software</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"fontsize-2-5-vw\"><span class=\"fontsize-3vw\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255,181,0);\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><br />\r\n</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-2vw\">Cranial surgery planning and navigation software powered by Q Guidance System</span></span></p>\r\n",
