      "line2": "<span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-2vw\"><span class=\"fontsize-2-5-vw\">Today’s robust cranial software provides full-spectrum active/passive hybrid optical tracking and&nbsp;automatic, algorithmic processing to help simplify core surgical tasks.</span></span></span>",
