          "jcr:created": "Tue Sep 27 2022 15:39:43 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-2em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Simplification</span><br>\n</span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Tools for identifying, marking and localizing targets and anatomical structures of interest</li>\n<li>Enables planning and aligning instruments to preplanned trajectories based on entry point and target</li>\n<li>High performance 2D-3D visualization</li>\n<li>Same-screen viewing of co-registered image sets from different imaging modalities or sequences individually in different 2D/3D views<br>\n</li>\n<li>Surgeon-driven dashboards replace toggling between workflow tabs</li>\n<li>Flexible surface registration (not mandated at setup)</li>\n<li>Ability to instantly correct patient orientation up to 45º in respective plane without creating new anatomical coordinate system</li>\n</ul>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Feb 28 2023 20:30:30 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
