          "text": "<h2><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"> </span><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"></span><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">Precision Targeting System:</span></span></span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Optional module for brain biopsy</span></span></span></h2>\n",
